# UI and UX

- Design for a dark premium training app, not a SaaS dashboard.
- Touch targets are at least 44×44. Respect safe-area insets and the home indicator.
- Keep the current tokens (lime accent, dark surfaces) until the visual-system wave.
- One icon family only. Wave 01 target is Flaticon UIcons Rounded Regular. Do not mix Lucide weights with a second set.
- Lottie only for workout complete, rest complete, syncing, and an empty progress state. Ship local files. Honor `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- No generic AI gradients. No medical advice in the interface.
